  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — Grank creature port (Pass 12).
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `Grank` ThingDef/PawnKindDef
  pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713), renamed under the
  RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim.

  Body: the donor's `<race><body>` for Grank points at `CorellianHound`
  (species defName differs from its body's own defName, confirmed by
  reading the donor's ThingDef directly, not assumed) — entirely
  vanilla-part composition, ported as RSW_CorellianHound with a defName
  rename only, no new body part needed (RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml).

  `leatherDef` stays vanilla Core `Leather_Plain` — no port needed.
  `specificMeatDef` repoints to the already-ported RSW_Reptomammal_Meat
  (RSW_MlieWaveB_Resources.xml). No egg comp (not an egg layer). No
  `canCrossBreedWith` in the donor.

  🔴 **ArtOverride collision avoided, checked BEFORE extracting anything**:
