  donor art). Per the Dragonsnake/Anooba same-path-collision trap
  (2026-09-12 finding), SWBestiary ships ONLY `Grank_Dessicated` — the base
  facing is NOT extracted here.

  Art: 1 PNG extracted this pass via extract_bundle.py against the live
  Steam workshop bundle (workshop folder 3497316713) — Grank_Dessicated,
